<title>USA: Ansaldo Signal gets $29.8 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Ansaldo Signal gets $29.8 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ansaldo Signal NV said Monday that its U.S. subsidiary, Union Switch &amp; Signal, has won a contract valued at $29.8 million to provide a driverless train control system for the Copenhagen MiniMetro project.</p>
</text>
